| **IN3**          | Motor B Direction |  **GPIO 27** | Digital Output |
| **IN4**          | Motor B Direction |   **GPIO 5** | Digital Output |
| **ENA**          | Motor A Speed     |  **GPIO 18** | PWM            |
| **ENB**          | Motor B Speed     |  **GPIO 19** | PWM            |

### Sieve Servo Pin Mapping

| Servo       | Function        | ESP32-B GPIO | Signal |
