# Wireless Communication

The two ESP32 nodes communicate wirelessly:

```text
┌──────────────────────┐
│      ESP32-A         │
│     Sensor Node      │
│                      │
│  HC-SR04 × 3         │
│  Distance Detection  │
└──────────┬───────────┘
           │
           │ Wireless
           │ Communication
           ▼
┌──────────────────────┐
│      ESP32-B         │
│    Actuator Node     │
│                      │
│  L298N Motor Driver  │
│  Motor A + Motor B   │
│  Servo 1 + Servo 2   │
└──────────────────────┘
```

> **Note:** The wireless implementation should be documented consistently with the actual firmware. If the current version uses standard Wi-Fi rather than ESP-NOW, describe it as **Wi-Fi communication** in the final README.

